    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "honestly, that's just the beginning. Coursera \nhas well over 10,000 courses from world-class  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498960,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "university professors. And on top of that, if you \nwant to learn genuinely useful skills for work,  "
